id: pm-review-host-pin
title: Pin the host so history verifies and keep CodeRabbit under the file cap
description: CI health fails because the pinned host drops per-test updated_by and updated_at when hashing history written by pm 2026.10.13. CodeRabbit also skips the pull request once changed files exceed 100. Raise the pinned host to 2026.10.13 and exclude the append-only history ledger from review counts without hiding the toon items.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-13T14:50:30.150Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-13T22:24:39.501Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-13T22:24:39.487Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-13T22:24:39.487Z"
author: pi-grok
acceptance_criteria: "Pinned devDependency, peer floor and manifest floor are 2026.10.13; pinned pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers exits 0; pinned pm history pm-review-round --verify exits 0; CodeRabbit path filter excludes history JSONL and leaves toon items reviewable; reviewable pull-request file count is under 100; npm and Bun release checks pass."
parent: pm-review-epic
release: 2026.10.12
resolution: Implemented and merged in #1 (fcf34e5).
expected_result: The change described by this item is on main.
actual_result: "Merged in #1 as fcf34e5; checks successful at head 3161974: CodeQL, codeql, test (22), test (26)."
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-13T14:50:40.314Z",pi-grok,"Pinned @unbrained/pm-cli devDependency to 2026.10.13, peer floor to >=2026.10.13, and manifest pm_min_version to 2026.10.13. README states the same floor. pm-ops stays at 2026.10.6: its peer is >=2026.8.20, so the pin does not require a bump. Did not rewrite history. Before further tracker writes, the pinned host verified pm-review-round (25 entries, current hash matches latest) and pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers exited 0 with history_drift ok."
  "2026-10-13T14:53:22.511Z",pi-grok,"CodeRabbit path filter excludes .agents/pm/history while leaving toon items reviewable. After this change the pull request has 119 changed paths, 36 history ledgers, and 83 reviewable files, under the 100-file cap. Linked health and history verification both passed on the pinned host. pm-ops was not bumped."
  "2026-10-13T14:58:00.970Z",pi-grok,"Gates passed on the pinned host. npm run release:check exit 0: identity 0 violations; 85/85 tests, 0 failed, cancelled, skipped or todo; coverage 100/100/100/100 over 17 authored sources; duplication 0/3451 lines; 50/50 declarations documented; production audit 0 vulnerabilities; pack dry-run 37 files; packed acceptance 1/1. bun run release:check exit 0 with the same 85/85, 100/100/100/100, 17 sources, 0/3451 duplication and 1/1 packed acceptance. Revert proof: before the pin, the 2026.10.10 host failed health with history_drift_chain_mismatch and history_drift_hash_mismatch on pm-review-round, and history --verify reported after_hash_mismatch on entry 23. The same commands pass after the pin without rewriting history."
  "2026-10-13T15:03:49.494Z",pi-grok,"Node 26 CI passed health, then packed acceptance failed in cleanup with ENOTEMPTY while removing the Bun install cache. The product assertions were not the failure. Recursive rm now retries that error. Local Node 26 acceptance passed before the retry option was added; the runner race is not reproducible here."
  "2026-10-13T15:06:53.006Z",pi-grok,"CI at 4d1bc45 passed test (22) and test (26), including pinned-host health, packed acceptance, and the Node 26 Bun release gate."
